{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1008958-an-idea-for-mage","id":1008958,"title":"An idea for Mage","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-11-27T10:11:33-08:00","id":1008958,"title":"An idea for Mage","content":"I came up with an idea for Mage and I want some advice on it. My basic idea is a scientific group named Project Prometheus who had recently figured out about the existence of Mages. But, instead of magic, they think Mages are humans who have unlocked the full potential of their brain. They seek Atlantis because they think that somewhere within the ruins of the city there is something that will cause them to be like the Mages, who they view as perfected humanity. This however, causes most mages to consider them a thorn in their sides due to the fact that whenever they find Atlantian ruins, they completely pillage them and take the artifacts back to their labs for study.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-27T11:02:18-08:00","id":1008976,"title":"","content":"It can work. Some things to keep in mind: The scenario assumes that Project Prometheus is made up of Sleepwalkers as Sleepers would destroy anything magically significant just by seeing it and inducing Unravelling. For Mages to actually consider them a nuisance they must have some way of keeping Mages out of their labs, otherwise Mages would be able to just let them take stuff and whenever a Mage wants it they could use magic to easily get it back. The base assumption that Project Prometheus has that any ruins they discover are Atlantean is pretty much baseless because of the fact that any magical society has been retroactively removed from existence and only exists as an echo of a vague Time Before and those echoes can give evidence of Atlantis or of other societies that are completely contradictory to the idea of Atlantis and everything in between.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-27T11:31:57-08:00","id":1008984,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1008958-an-idea-for-mage?p=1008976#post1008976\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It can work. Some things to keep in mind: The scenario assumes that Project Prometheus is made up of Sleepwalkers as Sleepers would destroy anything magically significant just by seeing it and inducing Unravelling. For Mages to actually consider them a nuisance they must have some way of keeping Mages out of their labs, otherwise Mages would be able to just let them take stuff and whenever a Mage wants it they could use magic to easily get it back. The base assumption that Project Prometheus has that any ruins they discover are Atlantean is pretty much baseless because of the fact that any magical society has been retroactively removed from existence and only exists as an echo of a vague Time Before and those echoes can give evidence of Atlantis or of other societies that are completely contradictory to the idea of Atlantis and everything in between.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bThey could have some kind of security system that keeps them out. Also. I got to think of a reason why the Seers of the Throne don't wipe them out of existence, the same with the Banishers. Also, their scientists are informally called &quot; Bubbleheads&quot; by younger mages due to the fact that the protective domes they wear while experimenting on magical artifacts look like clear, glass bubbles.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-27T11:50:48-08:00","id":1008987,"title":"","content":"Any nonmagical security systems will have a very difficult time keeping Mages out. Awakened magic is just too flexible, if there is any weakness in the system at all, Mages can and will exploit it. And simply being powered by electricity or made of matter is an exploitable weakness.<br /> <br /> On the other hand, if Project Prometheus has <i>any</i> Sleeper scientists, that's reason enough for the Mysterium to want to keep artifacts out of their hands. Heck, even the <i>possibility</i> of Sleepwers getting their hands on the Artifacts PP secures would be cause for concern, whether or not the possibility is realized.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-27T12:05:34-08:00","id":1008993,"title":"","content":"Something about the whole idea makes me think of some twist where the benefactor of this project is someone who can grant otherwise Sleeping people the ability to see magic without destroying it or hurting themselves.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8573-zombiecakes","name":"Zombiecakes","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"213"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-27T12:06:50-08:00","id":1008994,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1008958-an-idea-for-mage?p=1008987#post1008987\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Any nonmagical security systems will have a very difficult time keeping Mages out. Awakened magic is just too flexible, if there is any weakness in the system at all, Mages can and will exploit it. And simply being powered by electricity or made of matter is an exploitable weakness.<br /> <br /> On the other hand, if Project Prometheus has <i>any</i> Sleeper scientists, that's reason enough for the Mysterium to want to keep artifacts out of their hands. Heck, even the <i>possibility</i> of Sleepwers getting their hands on the Artifacts PP secures would be cause for concern, whether or not the possibility is realized.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bWell I got to think of something that would keep mages out. Also, sorry if the &quot;Bubblehead&quot; nickname sounded to immature. Also, I would think that the Seers would let them live because they think magic is just physic energy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-27T12:10:46-08:00","id":1008996,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zombiecakes</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1008958-an-idea-for-mage?p=1008993#post1008993\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Something about the whole idea makes me think of some twist where the benefactor of this project is someone who can grant otherwise Sleeping people the ability to see magic without destroying it or hurting themselves.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bThat sounds like a decent twist. But, what kind of mage would grant that?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":